{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36682","headline":"湘中见进士乔诩 · 罗隐","name":"湘中见进士乔诩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴公台下别经秋，破虏城边暂驻留。\n一笑有情堪解梦，数年无故不同游。\n云牵楚思横鱼艇，柳送乡心入酒楼。\n且酌松醪依旧醉，谁能相见向春愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}